  id: position-direction-distance
  title: Position, Direction & Distance
  explanation: Position tells you where you are relative to zero. Path length adds
    every metre travelled. Displacement compares your final position with your starting
    position.
  syllabus: NCERT Class 11 Physics - Motion in a Straight Line
